Why GPL-3.0-or-later:
PRISMATIC's Nintendo DS support integrates the melonDS emulator core, which is
licensed under GPL-3.0. Any distributed binary that links melonDS is therefore
GPL-3.0. To keep the whole project coherent and honor that copyleft, PRISMATIC's
own source is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later.

Third-party components retain their own licenses; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
The full text of the GNU General Public License version 3 is the canonical FSF
text available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt and applies to this
project. A copy should be distributed as COPYING with release builds
(scripts/package.sh fetches/embeds it for distribution).
